{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】啟德水上運動中心舉行開幕禮。</p>\n<p>康文署署長陳詠雯及立法會議員霍啟剛等為中心揭幕。中心位於跑道區，由前啟德消防局活化改建而成，保留紅白格外牆特色，佔地約4萬呎，提供龍舟、獨木舟、立划板、賽艇、帆船、竹筏及滑水等多項水上活動。</p>\n<p>中心自今年4月起試業，累積超過3.5萬人次使用。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:04:00.011771+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:44:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:37.653486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:26.196649+00:00","content_hash":"b7f113dfc80742eb8446c46037283cad6e83732497d6653d90d29a51348c2684","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}